From cc6ccb397052446059724a9d03deccb73225bf7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:43:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): recover remote notices after offline gaps
 [daveey] (#214)

Owner timestamps reject notices arriving more than six hours late, and replica updated_at is server time. Persist a host baseline and immutable first-seen terminal times shared by both consumers. Seed all terminal history only from a complete synchronized snapshot; never give frozen legacy keys a local freshness window. Cache unchanged snapshots to avoid per-chat ledger transactions.
